e a ring  because they know they can win here the  entire perception  of the franchise and in some ways the  city has changed  when did you realize how good how great  giannis could be  remember a game or a moment probably in  his third season jason kidd was the  coach  and the the team really wasn't going  anywhere may have been his fourth season  and kid just tossed the keys to him and  said  you play point guard for a while and  that's when he started having triple  doubles  i remember he had a triple-double the  night kobe bryant retired  well it was the year he retired it was  his last game in milwaukee  and after that game jason kidd set up a  private meeting off the bucks locker  room just kidd  giannis and kobe bryant and he honestly  had a triple-double that night the bucks  had won the game  and kobe bryant said to giannis you have  the talent to be as good as you want to  be  now do you want to work for it and i  think that  little light bulb above giannis's head  saying  man if kobe thinks i can do it i can do  it now i think he had that work  work ethic within him anyway but we all  need a little motivation right a jump  starter  something to kick us i think that did  and from that point on  we've seen giannis grow into this  full-blown battering ram mode that  is an mvp in the league and an mvp in  the finals what was the mood like when  the suns went up 2-0  um i don't think anybody panicked they  they knew they were coming home  they had played very well at home they  had been down  o2 in the brooklyn series and came back  and won the two home games to  flip the script to make it a 2-2 series  and they did it again  this group had some scars from the last  two seasons  where they were up 2-0 against toronto  in 2019 in the eastern conference finals  and lost four in a row  last year they lost focus when they went  into the bubble and they got bounced out  by  miami in a gentleman's sweep they had  been the top seed  the best record in the nba and it 