 super max contract next year that will  change his life it's generational money  and it's a great story phoenix sons  would like to recheck that paperwork of  uh giannis  just just saying there ted but uh hey  congratulations it's uh  not just players who suffer through this  it's certainly  you know people like you who are there  every single night you got to show up at  the building when you're winning 15  games people forget about that everybody  would love to be in the position you had  last night it sounded great  and uh congrats ted well thank you i had  a veteran when i got into the league in  my first year he said you know we don't  we don't get paid just to do the good  game  so you got to do the bad ones but when  you have a good one  you want to savor it yeah so thank you  but if  the bucks had lost would you have gone  with free fallen or  breakdown by tom peter tom  probably free falling yeah that's what  it would have felt like well congrats  get some sleep ted thanks for joining us  all right thank you dan bike all right  that's ted davis bucks play by play  announcer

